    "text": "<p>Co-ordination compounds absorb a particular wavelength following certain rules.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>Wavelength&#160;of&#160;light&#160;absorbed&#160;</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8733;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mtext>Oxidation&#160;state&#160;of&#160;metal&#160;ion</mtext></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8733;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mtext>Strength&#160;of&#160;ligand</mtext></mfrac></math></p><p>Ligand field strength -&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>CN</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List I<br />\t\t\tCoordination entity</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List II<br />\t\t\tWavelength of light absorbed in nm</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>CoCl</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>I.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>535</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</